	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Clarissime vir, mitto ad te has litteras tue humanitati in<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scriptas; unas accepi <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgo</placeName> a nostro <persName ref="p8511">Threcio</persName>, alteras <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>a gubernatore ill[ustrissimi] principis <persName ref="p8117">Nicolai Radzivili</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ducis in Olika filii.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nam ut scias, venit is nuper <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>litterarum gratia <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratum</placeName>, 14 annos natus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>puer bellissimus atque modestissimus, ad quem tu, si <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quid forte unquam ipsi duci scribere voles, commode <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>mittere poteris; transmittet enim sine negocio ad parentem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in <placeName ref="l841">Lituaniam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">De quo cum ego ab ipso gu<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>bernatore quaererem, seductusne sit necne a nostris tritheis, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>plane negavit affirmans eum ista, que geruntur, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vel ignorare vel eos, qui novum de trinitate <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>dogma invehunt, et frequenter et acerbe obiurgare solere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Favebat <persName ref="p7955">Blandratae</persName>, antequam, quid hominis esset, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>intellexisset, quem iam neglexit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Is autem in <placeName ref="l3246">Mol<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>daviam</placeName> ad despotam profectus esse dicitur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Threcium <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>iam in patriam propediem rediturum scio; nundinas <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>expectabat et cum d. <persName>Hipperio</persName> vixit aliquandiu.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Nondum omnes ministri acquiescunt piae illi et doctae <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>admonitioni tam <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> quam vestri Simleri; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>modestioribus certe satisfactum est abunde.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nuper <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ad me scripsit <persName ref="p8493">Paulus Gregorius</persName>, illius tabule de <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>trinitate fictor, eundem quem antea errorem mordi<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>cum asseverans; semper distinguit, nunquam tres un<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>um esse admittit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Litteras tuas abs te ad me <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>allatas e vestigio misi ad <persName>Cikovios</persName> <placeName ref="l284">Lipsiam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quod <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>autem hae sero ad te perveniunt, non mea sane cul<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>pa est, sed eorum, qui eas diu retinent, antequam <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>reddant, quarum alteras <placeName ref="l210">Heidelberga</placeName> huc mecum adtuli..</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Venimus enim huc aliquot <placeName ref="l2472">Poloni</placeName> pestis vitandae gratia, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>que iam non obscure <placeName ref="l210">Heidelberge</placeName> apparebat, et iam ipse, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>qui apud te nuper fuit, dominus <persName ref="p2406">Wenceslaus ab Ostrorog</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>una <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>cum fratre.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8318">Felix Cruciger</persName>, superintendens, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>cum orthodoxam de trinitate doctrinam in concione oppugnaret, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>subito fere concidens extinctus est.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Quod restat, te, patrem meum in domino venerandum, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>deo commendo et oro, ut diu felix valeas <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>nostramque pro tua virili ecclesiam iuves.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>tibi asscribit d. <persName ref="p2406">ab Ostrorog</persName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>me tuae praestantiae addictum esse velim scias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> 5. septembris 1563.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><persName ref="p8041">Iohannes La<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>sicius</persName> <placeName ref="l2472">Polonus</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>tuae dignitatis <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>studiosissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Adresse vor 225:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Clarissimo atque summa <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>pietate praedito viro d. <lb xml:id="p4z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heyricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>summo ecclesie <placeName ref="l587">Tigurine</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>pastori, patri in d. sin<lb xml:id="p4z6"/>gulari observantia colendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Darunter von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z7"/><persName ref="p8041">Ioannes Lasicius</persName> Polonus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
